    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0300_select_01",
      "hash64": "824DAB23CF8D7EF5",
      "text": "Tu parles de quoi ? Sauter dans le lac ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0300_select_02",
      "hash64": "824DA823CF8D79DC",
      "text": "Euh... Tu veux que je plonge ?!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0300_sister_06",
      "hash64": "0E4A11C22ADDB6DC",
      "text": "Bah oui ! Je sais pas nager, et surtout, j’ai pas\\nenvie de mouiller mes vêtements.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0300_sister_07",
      "hash64": "0E4A12C22ADDB88F",
      "text": "Et puis, t’as une Poké Monture tout-terrain, non ?\\nT’es la personne toute désignée ![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
